# The status line (game/status_message.h): "Enemy process eliminated" typed above the horizon
# when the bot dies. The arena shrinks to the smallest (2000 across) in the debug camera: the player
# soon crashes into the edge, and after the restart the bot, starting 2000 out, is outside the
